⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝

pool_init_container←{id←⍵
	n←⊃⍋container_pool[;pool_last_update]
	container_pool[n;pool_id]←id
	pool_update_container n
}

pool_init_treenode←{id←⍵
	n←⊃⍋treenode_pool[;pool_last_update]
	treenode_pool[n;pool_id]←id
	pool_update_treenode n
}

pool_update_container←{container_pool[⍵;pool_last_update]←frame ⋄ _←⍵}
pool_update_treenode←{treenode_pool[⍵;pool_last_update]←frame ⋄ _←⍵}

pool_get←{pool←⍺ ⋄ id←⍵ ⋄ (≢⍺)=i←⍺[;pool_id]⍳⍵:¯1 ⋄ i}

⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝
⍝ Input Handlers                                                               ⍝
⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝

input_mousemove←{mouse_pos∘←⍵ ⋄ _←0}
input_mousedown←{input_mousemove ⍵: ⋄ mouse_down[⍺]←mouse_pressed[⍺]←1 ⋄ _←0}
input_mouseup←{input_mousemove ⍵: ⋄ mouse_down[⍺]←0 ⋄ _←0}
input_scroll←{scroll_delta+←⍵ ⋄ _←0}
input_keydown←{key_pressed[⍵]←key_down[⍵]←1 ⋄ _←0}
input_keyup←{key_down[⍵]←0 ⋄ _←0}
input_text←{text_input,←⍵ ⋄ _←0}

⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝
⍝ Command List                                                                 ⍝
⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝

push_command←{command_list[command_list_idx]←⊂⍵ ⋄ command_list_idx+←1 ⋄ _←0}

∇cmd←next_command cmd
 cmd+←1
 
∆:→END⌿⍨cmd≥command_list_idx ⋄ →JMP⌿⍨COMMAND_JUMP=⊃cmd⊃command_list ⋄ →NOTJMP
JMP:	cmd←cmd jump_dst⊃command_list 	⋄ →∆
NOTJMP:					⋄ →0
END:	cmd←¯1 			⋄ →0
∇

push_jump←{push_command COMMAND_JUMP ⍵}
set_clip←{push_command COMMAND_CLIP ⍵}

draw_rect←{rx ry rw rh←rect←⍺ intersect_rects get_clip_rect
	assert rect=⌊rect:
	(rw>0)∧rh>0:push_command COMMAND_RECT rect ⍵
_←0}

draw_box←{rx ry rw rh←⍺
	(rx+1)ry(rw-2)1 draw_rect ⍵:
	(rx+1)(¯1+ry+rh)(rw-2)1 draw_rect ⍵:
	rx ry 1 rh draw_rect ⍵:
	(¯1+rx+rw)ry 1 rh draw_rect ⍵:
_←0}

draw_text←{font←⍺ ⋄ str pos color←⍵
	rect←pos,(font text_width str)(text_height font)
	CLIP_ALL=clipped←check_clip rect:_←0
	_←set_clip⍣(clipped=CLIP_PART)⊢get_clip_rect
	push_command COMMAND_TEXT font pos color str:
	clipped≠0:set_clip UNCLIPPED_RECT
_←0}

draw_icon←{id←⍺ ⋄ rect color←⍵
	CLIP_ALL=clipped←check_clip rect:_←0
	_←set_clip⍣(clipped=CLIP_PART)⊢get_clip_rect
	push_command COMMAND_ICON rect id color:
	clipped≠0:set_clip UNCLIPPED_RECT
_←0}

draw_image←{img←⍺ ⋄ pos←⍵ ⋄ push_command COMMAND_IMAGE,(⊂img),pos}

⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝
⍝ Layout                                                                       ⍝
⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝

push_layout←{body←⍺ ⋄ scroll←⍵ 
	layout_stack[layout_stack_idx;]←0
	layout_stack[layout_stack_idx;lyt_body]←body-scroll,0 0
	layout_stack[layout_stack_idx;lyt_max]←¯16777216 ¯16777216
	layout_stack_idx+←1
	0 layout_row 1 0
}

∇z←get_layout
 z←layout_stack_idx-1
∇

∇{z}←layout_begin_column
 z←0 ⋄ layout_next push_layout 0 0
∇

∇{z}←layout_end_column;a;b;flds;apx;abx;aby;anr;bpx;bbx;bpy;bnr
 z←0 ⋄ flds←(⊃lyt_position),lyt_body[⍳2],lyt_next_row
 b←layout_stack[get_layout;] ⋄ layout_stack_idx-←1 ⋄ a←get_layout
 apx abx aby anr←layout_stack[a;flds] ⋄ bpx bbx bby bnr←b[flds]
 layout_stack[a;⊃lyt_position]⌈←(bpx+bbx)-abx
 layout_stack[a;lyt_next_row]⌈←(bnr+bby)-aby
 layout_stack[a;lyt_max]⌈←b[lyt_max]
∇

layout_row←{⍺←⍬ ⋄ widths←⍺ ⋄ items height←⍵ ⋄ lyt←get_layout
	assert MAX_WIDTHS≥≢widths: ⋄ assert 0 items∨.=≢widths:
	layout_stack[lyt;i↑lyt_widths]←widths↑⍨i←items×widths≢⍬
	layout_stack[lyt;lyt_item_index,lyt_items,1⊃lyt_size]←0 items height
	layout_stack[lyt;lyt_position]←layout_stack[lyt;lyt_indent,lyt_next_row]
_←0}

layout_width←{width←⍵
	layout_stack[get_layout;⊃lyt_size]←width
_←0}

layout_height←{height←⍵
	layout_stack[get_layout;1⊃lyt_size]←height
_←0}

layout_set_next←{relative←ABSOLUTE RELATIVE[⍺] ⋄ r←⍵
	layout_stack[get_layout;lyt_next,lyt_next_type]←r,relative
_←0}

∇res←layout_next;lyt;type;t
 lyt←get_layout ⋄ type←layout_stack[lyt;lyt_next_type]
 
 layout_stack[lyt;lyt_next_type]←0
 last_rect←res←layout_stack[lyt;lyt_next]
 →⊃⍬ 0 UPDATE[0 ABSOLUTE⍳type]
 
 t←layout_stack[lyt;lyt_item_index]=layout_stack[lyt;lyt_items]
 {}layout_row⍣t⊢layout_stack[lyt;lyt_items,1⊃lyt_size]
 
 res←layout_stack[lyt;lyt_position,lyt_size]
 t←layout_stack[lyt;lyt_items]>0
 res[2]{t⊃⍺ ⍵}←layout_stack[lyt;lyt_widths][layout_stack[lyt;lyt_item_index]]
 
 res[2 3]←(res[2 3]×~t)+(t←res[2 3]=0)×style_size+style_padding×2
 res[2 3]+←(res[2 3]<0)×(layout_stack[lyt;lyt_body[2 3]]-res[0 1])+1
 
 layout_stack[lyt;lyt_item_index]+←1
 
UPDATE:
 layout_stack[lyt;⊃lyt_position]+←res[2]+style_padding
 layout_stack[lyt;lyt_next_row]⌈←res[1]+res[3]+style_spacing

 res[0 1]+←layout_stack[lyt;lyt_body][0 1]

 layout_stack[lyt;lyt_max]⌈←res[0 1]+res[2 3]

 last_rect←res
∇

⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝
⍝ Controls                                                                     ⍝
⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝

draw_control_frame←{⍺←MT_OPT ⋄ opt←⍺ ⋄ id rect clr clrhov clrfoc←⍵
	opt[OPT_NOFRAME]:_←0
	draw_frame rect (clr clrhov clrfoc⊃⍨(2×focus=id)+(hover=id)∧focus≠id)
_←0}

draw_control_frame_button←{⍺←MT_OPT
	⍺ draw_control_frame ⍵,color_button color_buttonhover color_buttonfocus
}

draw_control_frame_base←{⍺←MT_OPT
	⍺ draw_control_frame ⍵,color_base color_basehover color_basefocus
}

draw_control_text←{⍺←MT_OPT ⋄ opt←⍺ ⋄ str rect color←⍵
	pos←0 0
	tw←style_font text_width str
	push_clip_rect rect:
	pos[1]←rect[1]+⌊(rect[3]-text_height style_font)÷2
	pos[0]←(t←opt[OPT_ALIGNCENTER])×rect[0]+⌊(rect[2]-tw)÷2
	pos[0]+←(t∨←t<opt[OPT_ALIGNRIGHT])×((rect[0]+rect[2])-tw)-style_padding
	pos[0]+←(~t)×rect[0]+style_padding
	style_font draw_text str pos color:
	pop_clip_rect
}


mouse_over←{rect←⍵
	msk←rect rect_overlaps_vec2 mouse_pos
	msk∧←get_clip_rect rect_overlaps_vec2 mouse_pos
	msk∧in_hover_root
}

update_control←{⍺←MT_OPT ⋄ opt←⍺ ⋄ id rect←⍵
	mouseover←mouse_over rect
	updated_focus∨←focus=id
	opt[OPT_NOINTERACT]:_←0
	hover∘←(hover×~msk)+id×msk←mouseover>∨⌿mouse_down
	msk←mouseover<∨⌿mouse_pressed
	msk∨←opt[OPT_HOLDFOCUS]⍱∨⌿mouse_down
	set_focus⍣(msk∧focus=id)⊢0:
	(∨⌿mouse_pressed)∧hover=id:set_focus id
	mouseover<hover=id:hover∘←0
_←0}

text←{txt←⍵ ⋄ layout_begin_column: ⋄ ¯1 layout_row 1,text_height style_font:
	txt≡'':layout_end_column
	r←layout_next ⋄ a←0 ⋄ t←''
	_←{ 
		w←style_font text_width ⍵
		(0≠≢t)∧(r[2]<a+w)∨(⊃⌽t)=⎕UCS 10:{
			style_font draw_text t (2↑r) color_text:
			a∘←w ⋄ t∘←⍵ ⋄ r∘←layout_next
		0}⍵
		a+←w ⋄ t,←⍵
	0}¨txt⊂⍨1,¯1↓txt∊' ',⎕UCS 10
	_←{style_font draw_text t(2↑r)color_text}⍣(0≠≢t)⊢0
	_←{layout_next}⍣((⊃⌽t)=⎕UCS 10)⊢0
	layout_end_column:
_←0}

label←{txt←⍵ ⋄ draw_control_text txt layout_next color_text}

image←{img←⍵ ⋄ ⍵ draw_image 2↑layout_next}

button←{⍺←0(1@OPT_ALIGNCENTER⊢MT_OPT) ⋄ icon opt←⍺ ⋄ label←⍵ ⋄ res←MT_RES
	id←get_id (label≡'')⊃label icon ⋄ r←layout_next
	opt update_control id r:
	res[RES_SUBMIT]←(focus=id)∧1 0 0≡mouse_pressed
	opt draw_control_frame_button id r:
	_←opt draw_control_text⍣(label≢'')⊢label r color_text
	_←icon draw_icon⍣(icon≠0)⊢r color_text
	1:_←res
}

checkbox←{id←get_id ⍺ ⋄ label state←⍵ ⋄ res←MT_RES ⋄ r←layout_next
	box←r[0 1 3 3]
	update_control id r:
	state≠←res[RES_CHANGE]←(focus=id)∧1 0 0≡mouse_pressed
	draw_control_frame_base id box:
	_←ICON_CHECK draw_icon⍣state⊢box color_text
	r[0 2]+←1 ¯1×box[2]
	draw_control_text label r color_text:
	res state
}

textbox_raw←{⍺←MT_OPT ⋄ opt←⍺ ⋄ buf id r←⍵ ⋄ res←MT_RES
	(1@OPT_HOLDFOCUS⊢opt)update_control id r:
	res[RES_CHANGE]←0≠≢buf,←(f←focus=id)⌿text_input
	res[RES_CHANGE]⌈←0≠buf↓⍨←-f∧key_pressed[KEY_BACKSPACE]
	set_focus⍣(res[RES_SUBMIT]←f∧key_pressed[KEY_RETURN])⊢0:
	opt draw_control_frame_base id r:
	focus≠id:res buf⊣opt draw_control_text buf r color_text
	tw←style_font text_width buf ⋄ th←text_height style_font
	ofx←((r[2]-style_padding)-tw)-1
	txy←(2↑r)+(ofx⌊style_padding)(⌊(r[3]-th)÷2)
	push_clip_rect r:
	style_font draw_text buf txy color_text:
	(tw 0 0 0+txy,1 th)draw_rect color_text:
	pop_clip_rect:
	1:_←res buf
}

number_textbox←{id←⍺ ⋄ value r←⍵
	t←(1 0 0≡mouse_pressed)∧key_down[KEY_SHIFT]∧hover=id
	number_edit←t⊃number_edit id
	number_edit_buf←t⊃number_edit_buf (⍕value)
	number_edit≠id:0 value
	res←textbox_raw number_edit_buf id r
	res[RES_SUBMIT]⍱focus≠id:1 value
	value←1⊃⎕VFI number_edit_buf
	number_edit←0
	0
}

textbox←{⍺←MT_OPT ⋄ opt←⍺ ⋄ lbl buf←⍵ ⋄ id←get_id lbl ⋄ textbox_raw buf id layout_next}

slider←{⍺←MT_OPT ⋄ opt←⍺ ⋄ id value low high step spec←⍵ ⋄ res←MT_RES
	id←get_id id ⋄ last←value ⋄ base←layout_next
	⊃_ value←id number_textbox value base:res value
	opt update_control id base:
	f←(focus=id)∧1 0 0≡mouse_down∨mouse_pressed
	value←{low+((mouse_pos[0]-base[0])×high-low)÷base[2]}⍣f⊢value
	value←{step×⌊(value+step÷2)÷step}⍣(f∧0≠step)⊢value
	value←low⌈high⌊value
	res[RES_CHANGE]∨←last≠value
	opt draw_control_frame_base id base:
	x←⌊((value-low)×base[2]-style_thumb_size)÷high-low
	thumb←x 0 style_thumb_size 0+base×1 1 0 1
	opt draw_control_frame_button id thumb:
	opt draw_control_text (spec⍕value)base color_text:
	res value
}

